1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:01,940
You've turned completely invisible.

2
00:00:02,621 --> 00:00:03,321
First problem:

3
00:00:03,781 --> 00:00:04,441
you're blind.

4
00:00:05,041 --> 00:00:05,541
To see,

5
00:00:05,781 --> 00:00:07,382
your eyes have to catch light.

6
00:00:07,902 --> 00:00:09,742
Invisible eyes let it pass straight

7
00:00:09,782 --> 00:00:10,082
through.

8
00:00:10,843 --> 00:00:11,563
Second problem:

9
00:00:12,003 --> 00:00:13,583
you're not really invisible.

10
00:00:14,103 --> 00:00:16,144
Your body bends light like glass,

11
00:00:16,424 --> 00:00:18,304
so people see a shimmering outline

12
00:00:18,344 --> 00:00:18,605
of you.

13
00:00:19,105 --> 00:00:20,245
To vanish completely,

14
00:00:20,485 --> 00:00:22,245
you'd have to bend light exactly

15
00:00:22,305 --> 00:00:22,886
like air.

16
00:00:23,586 --> 00:00:24,906
And that sandwich you just ate?

17
00:00:25,486 --> 00:00:26,827
Everyone can watch it float...

18
00:00:27,487 --> 00:00:29,527
and slowly get digested inside you.

19
00:00:30,147 --> 00:00:31,228
Rain makes it worse.

20
00:00:31,788 --> 00:00:33,988
Every drop splashes off your invisible

21
00:00:34,028 --> 00:00:34,348
body.

22
00:00:34,889 --> 00:00:36,169
So you stand still in the

23
00:00:36,209 --> 00:00:36,569
kitchen...

24
00:00:37,149 --> 00:00:38,029
and take another bite.

